===NickCries
Nick falls to his knees in tears. #speaker: Narrorator #portrait:narrorator #layout:left
He leaves with you peacefully and returns to town where you hand him over to higher authorities
Nick gives you one last glance as they handcuff and move him into the truck.
->END

===ArrestNick
A fierce struggle breaks out between Marcus and Nick. They tumble and claw on the dirt floor.  #speaker: Narrorator #portrait:narrorator #layout:left
As Nick trips he lands onto the mysterious liquid that covered part of the ground.
The room goes silent for a moment as, as the dust settles nobody appears. Nick is gone
->END
===DoTheRitual
Nick brings up a rusty hatchet and brings it down hard on your sacrificed finger.  #speaker: Narrorator #portrait:Narrorator #layout:left
He throws it into a pool of some unknown substance on the ground.
The room goes silent for a moment as, as the dust settles a silhouette begins to take shape in the shadows
Marcus... Why... #speaker: Emma #portrait:Narrorator #layout:left
->END




